IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `caa-passenger`

-- Carriage by Air Act 1988, Arts 1, 3, 4, 17 to 30 of the Schedules and ss 5 to 10 -- the passenger -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_carriage-by-air-act-1988_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

