§ `Article 1 and s 10`

#ASSERT `Does the Convention govern my journey` `the Warsaw (Hague) Convention` `Singapore to London for a fare`
#ASSERT `Does the Convention govern my journey` `the Warsaw (Hague) Convention` `Singapore to Singapore via Batam`
#ASSERT NOT `Does the Convention govern my journey` `the Warsaw (Hague) Convention` `a domestic hop with no foreign stop`
#ASSERT `Does the Convention govern my journey` `the Warsaw (Hague) Convention` `free seat from an airline`
#ASSERT NOT `Does the Convention govern my journey` `the Warsaw (Hague) Convention` `a military charter`
#ASSERT `Does the Convention govern my journey` `the Warsaw Convention` `a military charter`

§ `Articles 17 to 20 and s 5`

#ASSERT `Is the carrier liable to me` `the Warsaw (Hague) Convention` `hurt in turbulence`
#ASSERT NOT `Is the carrier liable to me` `the Warsaw (Hague) Convention` `hurt in the terminal shop`
#ASSERT `Is the carrier liable to me` `the Warsaw (Hague) (Montreal) Convention` `bag damaged in carrier's charge`
